#region Revision log
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Revision log:
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CNC 11/15/18  -  (19.85) Initial configuration for 3-axis and 4-axis Siemens 840D / 828D /808D for Mastercam 2017
# CNC 11/15/18  -  (20.85) Migrated files to Mastercam 2018
# CNC 11/15/18  -  (21.85) Migrated files to Mastercam 2019
# CNC 02/14/19  -  (22.85) Initial post update for Mastercam 2020
# CNC 02/28/19  -  (22.86) Addressed issue causing stage tool output to be blank
# CNC 04/15/19  -  (22.87) Fix post text to enable Feed rate, Clearance, Retract with drill cycles
